# Order Analytics Service API Tests

### Health Check
# Confirms that the Flask service is running successfully.
GET http://localhost:4000/health
Accept: application/json

### Consumed Orders
# Returns every order processed from RabbitMQ since the service started.
GET http://localhost:4000/orders
Accept: application/json

### Analytics Summary
GET http://localhost:4000/analytics/summary
Accept: application/json

### Product Analytics
GET http://localhost:4000/analytics/products
Accept: application/json

### Top Products
GET http://localhost:4000/analytics/top-products
Accept: application/json